# Applies to `docker build -f davinci-sequencer/Dockerfile .` run from the
# parent directory (BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore beside the
# Dockerfile). Paths are relative to that parent. Only the sequencer
# workspace and the davinci-zkvm crates it path-depends on are sent.
*
!davinci-sequencer
!davinci-zkvm/Cargo.toml
!davinci-zkvm/rust-sdk
!davinci-zkvm/input-gen

**/target
**/.git
**/.github
**/tests/cache
**/*.redb
davinci-sequencer/arbo/fuzz/corpus
davinci-sequencer/arbo/fuzz/artifacts
davinci-sequencer/Dockerfile*
davinci-sequencer/docker-compose.yml
# Compose configuration and secrets.
**/.env*
**/*.key
davinci-sequencer/letsencrypt
